meta {
  name: Xolo API
  type: collection
  version: 1
}

docs {
  Xolo one-to-one chat REST API collection.

  Start the app with `pnpm dev` and select the Local environment. Register or log in, find a person by name or email, copy their id into `recipientId`, and create a direct chat. The response saves its id as `chatId`. Use `{{$guid}}` for a fresh message id each time you send a message; copy a message id into `messageId` to try a reaction.
}
